ب هست؟","en":"Are there any tickets for tonight?"},{"fa":"بليط براي فردا هست.","en":"There are some tickets for tomorrow."},{"fa":"مادرت مأموريته؟","en":"Is your mother on mission?"},{"fa":"از دوستت چه خبر؟","en":"Any news from your friend?"}],"words":[],"proverb":[],"conversation":[]}